{"id": "EUVD-2026-96993", "enisaUuid": "4dfcde3a-acdb-35f9-a435-d97dfd0f6cdd", "description": "LLMGateway through 1.20.0 contains a blind server-side request forgery vulnerability that allows API key holders to reach internal hosts via the video-generation callback_url extension. Attackers can supply loopback, private, or cloud-metadata URLs that deliverWebhook POSTs to without the assertSafeWebhookTarget check, reaching internal services from the worker's network.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T13:24:03", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind03/theopenco-llmgateway-video-callback-ssrf-no-egress-guard", "https://github.com/theopenco/llmgateway/blob/c84ba987da18edd80358a3450ccaea75c5c67ca8/apps/gateway/src/videos/videos.ts#L374-L383", "https://github.com/theopenco/llmgateway/blob/c84ba987da18edd80358a3450ccaea75c5c67ca8/apps/worker/src/services/video-jobs.ts#L2490-L2499", "https://github.com/theopenco/llmgateway/blob/c84ba987da18edd80358a3450ccaea75c5c67ca8/apps/worker/src/worker.ts#L2961-L2971", "https://github.com/theopenco/llmgateway", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/llmgateway-through-1.20.0-blind-ssrf-via-video-generation-callback-url"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108719", "GHSA-c996-f546-j683"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "9b25151a-9313-31f8-9818-5073b82f7bcf", "product": {"name": "LLMGateway", "vendor": {"name": "theopenco"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.20.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a756e991-1f27-3845-8d9e-f83a6adc6f8a", "vendor": {"name": "theopenco"}}], "isExploited": false}